.TH GRID_SELECT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_select \- Move the cursor to item i, clamped into 0..count\-1, and scroll the window so it is visible
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "void grid_select(Grid *g, int i);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move the cursor to item i, clamped into 0..count\-1, and scroll the window so it is visible. The way to preselect an item or to restore the cursor after rebuilding the list.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_move (3),
.BR grid_set_count (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
